1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,241
Mummy ne apne shaadi ke kangan jeweller ke counter par rakhe.

2
00:00:05,241 --> 00:00:10,005
Unhe laga, itne saal mein sona kitna mehnga ho gaya.

3
00:00:10,005 --> 00:00:15,246
Aaj toh achha paisa milega. Jeweller ne kangan tole, calculator chalaya,

4
00:00:15,246 --> 00:00:20,010
aur muskura kar rakam batayi. Mummy ka chehra utar gaya.

5
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:24,457
Rakam kam nahi thi, par umeed se bahut kam thi.

6
00:00:24,457 --> 00:00:28,903
Jeweller ne kaha, behenji, design ka paisa wapas nahi milta.

7
00:00:28,903 --> 00:00:33,350
Main sirf sona tolta hoon, woh bhi purity check karke.

8
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,239
Mummy boli,

9
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:38,686
kharidte waqt toh design ka bhi poora paisa diya tha.

10
00:00:38,686 --> 00:00:40,020
Jeweller chup raha.

11
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:43,920
Ghar aakar Mummy ne Papa ko sab bataya. Papa bole,

12
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:47,430
sona kabhi dhokha nahi deta, yeh toh safe hai.

13
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:50,940
Behen ne phone se nazar uthayi aur poocha, Papa,

14
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,060
safe aur kamaai, kya dono same baat hain?

15
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,790
Kamre mein thodi der sannata chha gaya.

16
00:00:56,790 --> 00:01:00,094
Yeh kahani lagbhag har Indian ghar ki hai.

17
00:01:00,094 --> 00:01:04,223
Hum sone ko suraksha maante hain, aur sahi bhi hai,

18
00:01:04,223 --> 00:01:06,701
mushkil waqt mein kaam aata hai.

19
00:01:06,701 --> 00:01:12,069
Par asli sawaal yeh hai ki kaun sa sona sach mein kamata hai.

20
00:01:12,069 --> 00:01:14,960
Gehna, gold ETF, ya sovereign gold bond?

21
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:18,269
Aaj ke sawaal seedhe hain. Pehla,

22
00:01:18,269 --> 00:01:23,232
gehne par making charge kahan chala jaata hai? Doosra,

23
00:01:23,232 --> 00:01:27,092
locker ka kharcha kaun ginta hai? Teesra,

24
00:01:27,092 --> 00:01:32,055
gold bond par 2.5 percent extra kaise milta hai?

25
00:01:32,055 --> 00:01:37,570
Aur aakhir mein, gehna kab kharidari hai, aur kab investment.

26
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:42,464
Chalo peeche chalte hain, us din jab kangan khareede gaye the.

27
00:01:42,464 --> 00:01:46,023
Shaadi ki taiyaari thi, ghar mein raunak thi.

28
00:01:46,023 --> 00:01:50,027
Papa aur Mummy jeweller ki dukaan par baithe the.

29
00:01:50,027 --> 00:01:53,586
Saamne trays mein chamakte kangan, haar aur jhumke.

30
00:01:53,586 --> 00:01:56,700
Har cheez par price tag laga tha.

31
00:01:56,700 --> 00:02:01,779
Jeweller ne bill banaya, toh usme kai line thi. Pehli,

32
00:02:01,779 --> 00:02:07,367
sone ka wazan aur us din ka bhaav. Doosri, making charge.

33
00:02:07,367 --> 00:02:12,954
Phir upar se GST. Papa ne sirf neeche likha total dekha,

34
00:02:12,954 --> 00:02:16,510
aur bina sawaal kiye paise de diye.

35
00:02:16,510 --> 00:02:19,959
Making charge yaani gehna banane ki mazdoori,

36
00:02:19,959 --> 00:02:24,393
karigar ki mehnat ka paisa. Sona toh sona hai,

37
00:02:24,393 --> 00:02:27,841
par kangan ki nakkashi, haar ki jaali,

38
00:02:27,841 --> 00:02:32,275
yeh sab haath ka kaam hai. Jitna baareek design,

39
00:02:32,275 --> 00:02:37,202
utna zyada making charge. Aur yeh paisa sone mein nahi,

40
00:02:37,202 --> 00:02:38,680
design mein gaya.

41
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:42,664
Ab yahan woh baat aati hai jo koi nahi batata.

42
00:02:42,664 --> 00:02:45,055
Jab aap gehna bechne jaate ho,

43
00:02:45,055 --> 00:02:47,844
jeweller sirf sone ka wazan dekhta hai.

44
00:02:47,844 --> 00:02:50,633
Making charge ka paisa wapas nahi aata.

45
00:02:50,633 --> 00:02:55,016
Upar se purane gehne par kuch katauti bhi ho sakti hai,

46
00:02:55,016 --> 00:02:56,610
purity ke naam par.

47
00:02:56,610 --> 00:02:59,770
Matlab samjho. Jis din aapne gehna khareeda,

48
00:02:59,770 --> 00:03:04,284
usi din aapka kuch paisa hamesha ke liye chala gaya.

49
00:03:04,284 --> 00:03:08,798
Sone ka bhaav badhega, tab jaakar pehle woh nuksaan bharega.

50
00:03:08,798 --> 00:03:11,957
Uske baad hi asli kamaai shuru hogi.

51
00:03:11,957 --> 00:03:16,020
Yaani gehne ki race peeche se shuru hoti hai.

52
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:18,394
GST ka bhi yahi haal hai.

53
00:03:18,394 --> 00:03:22,747
Kharidte waqt aapne sone aur making charge, dono par GST diya.

54
00:03:22,747 --> 00:03:26,308
Bechte waqt jeweller woh GST aapko wapas nahi deta.

55
00:03:26,308 --> 00:03:30,265
Woh bhi seedha kharcha hai. Bill mein chhota dikhta hai,

56
00:03:30,265 --> 00:03:33,430
par saalon baad hisaab mein bada lagta hai.

57
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:37,403
Toh kya gehna khareedna galat hai? Bilkul nahi.

58
00:03:37,403 --> 00:03:42,865
Beti ki shaadi mein Mummy ke kangan ki jo chamak hogi,

59
00:03:42,865 --> 00:03:48,328
uski keemat calculator se nahi nikalti. Woh khushi hai, yaad hai,

60
00:03:48,328 --> 00:03:53,294
parampara hai. Bas use investment mat bolo. Woh kharidari hai,

61
00:03:53,294 --> 00:03:55,280
nayi saree ki tarah.

62
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,453
Ab doosra sawaal.

63
00:03:56,453 --> 00:04:01,144
Shaadi ke baad gehna ghar mein rakhna Papa ko theek nahi laga.

64
00:04:01,144 --> 00:04:04,662
Chori ka darr tha, mehmaan aate jaate rehte the.

65
00:04:04,662 --> 00:04:08,572
Toh Papa bank pahunche, aur Bank Uncle se locker maanga.

66
00:04:08,572 --> 00:04:12,090
Bank Uncle ne form diya aur saalana kiraya bataya.

67
00:04:12,090 --> 00:04:19,395
Bade shehar ki SBI branch mein chhote locker ka kiraya lagbhag 2,000 rupaye saal ka hai.

68
00:04:19,395 --> 00:04:23,961
Aur yeh 2,000 bhi poora nahi, upar se GST alag.

69
00:04:23,961 --> 00:04:27,614
Papa bole, bas itna sa? Chalo theek hai.

70
00:04:27,614 --> 00:04:32,180
Aur woh kiraya har saal chupchaap account se katne laga.

71
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:35,014
Locker par GST 18 percent lagta hai,

72
00:04:35,014 --> 00:04:37,443
kyunki yeh bank ki service hai.

73
00:04:37,443 --> 00:04:41,087
Yaani 2,000 ka kiraya asal mein usse zyada pada.

74
00:04:41,087 --> 00:04:47,161
Papa ne kabhi socha nahi ki yeh kharcha bhi sone ke hisaab mein judna chahiye.

75
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:49,590
Sach kahun toh, koi nahi sochta.

76
00:04:49,590 --> 00:04:53,280
Yeh kharcha chhota lagta hai, isliye chhup jaata hai.

77
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:55,740
Par yeh har saal aata hai,

78
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:58,610
chahe sone ka bhaav badhe ya gire.

79
00:04:58,610 --> 00:05:01,890
Jitne saal gehna locker mein, utne saal kiraya.

80
00:05:01,890 --> 00:05:06,810
Aur locker ki chaabi ke saath aata hai bank jaane ka time,

81
00:05:06,810 --> 00:05:08,040
line aur form.

82
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:12,856
Ab socho, kai saal baad Mummy kangan bechti hain.

83
00:05:12,856 --> 00:05:18,742
Unhe sone ka bhaav dikhta hai, badha hua. Par making charge,

84
00:05:18,742 --> 00:05:23,558
GST, locker ka kiraya, aur bechte waqt ki katauti,

85
00:05:23,558 --> 00:05:25,164
yeh sab ghatao.

86
00:05:25,164 --> 00:05:31,050
Tab pata chalta hai ki gehne ne asal mein kitna kamaya.

87
00:05:31,050 --> 00:05:33,288
Bhai ne phone nikala aur bola,

88
00:05:33,288 --> 00:05:36,645
sona toh har saal badhta hai, problem kya hai?

89
00:05:36,645 --> 00:05:39,629
Behen ne turant kaha, har saal nahi badhta,

90
00:05:39,629 --> 00:05:42,239
kabhi girta bhi hai. Aur bhaav badhe,

91
00:05:42,239 --> 00:05:44,477
toh bhi kamaai alag cheez hai.

92
00:05:44,477 --> 00:05:48,580
Kamaai woh hai jo saare kharche ke baad haath mein aaye.

93
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:51,952
Ab teesra sawaal, jahan kahani mein twist hai.

94
00:05:51,952 --> 00:05:56,590
Kya aisa sona ho sakta hai jisme making charge na ho,

95
00:05:56,590 --> 00:06:00,805
locker na ho, aur upar se byaaj bhi mile? Haan,

96
00:06:00,805 --> 00:06:02,913
isko kehte hain paper gold.

97
00:06:02,913 --> 00:06:07,550
Yaani sona jo kaagaz ya screen par hai, almari mein nahi.

98
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:10,895
Pehla roop hai sovereign gold bond, chhota naam SGB.

99
00:06:10,895 --> 00:06:14,240
Yeh sarkar ki taraf se RBI jaari karta hai.

100
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,470
RBI yaani desh ka central bank,

101
00:06:16,470 --> 00:06:20,187
jo banks ka bhi bank hai. Aap sona nahi khareedte,

102
00:06:20,187 --> 00:06:23,160
sone ke grams ke barabar bond khareedte ho.

103
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:27,633
Is bond ki keemat sone ke bhaav ke saath chalti hai.

104
00:06:27,633 --> 00:06:31,698
Sona mehnga hua, toh bond bhi mehnga. Sona sasta hua,

105
00:06:31,698 --> 00:06:33,325
toh bond bhi sasta.

106
00:06:33,325 --> 00:06:37,391
Yaani sone ka risk wahi hai jo gehne mein hai.

107
00:06:37,391 --> 00:06:41,050
Bas making charge, locker aur purity ki tension nahi.

108
00:06:41,050 --> 00:06:44,586
Ab asli twist. Sone ke bhaav ke upar,

109
00:06:44,586 --> 00:06:48,564
SGB har saal 2.5 percent fixed byaaj deta hai.

110
00:06:48,564 --> 00:06:52,100
Yeh byaaj aapki shuruaati rakam par milta hai,

111
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:55,636
yaani jitne ka bond khareeda tha, us par.

112
00:06:55,636 --> 00:06:57,846
Gehna aapko byaaj nahi deta.

113
00:06:57,846 --> 00:07:00,940
Woh sirf locker mein baitha rehta hai.

114
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:05,773
Is tarah samjho. Mummy ke kangan locker mein so rahe hain,

115
00:07:05,773 --> 00:07:07,969
aur kiraya maang rahe hain.

116
00:07:07,969 --> 00:07:11,045
Bond wala sona bhi chupchaap baitha hai,

117
00:07:11,045 --> 00:07:14,999
par har saal 2.5 percent byaaj de raha hai.

118
00:07:14,999 --> 00:07:19,392
Sona dono jagah same hai. Par gehna kharcha karwata hai,

119
00:07:19,392 --> 00:07:20,710
bond kamata hai.

120
00:07:20,710 --> 00:07:24,781
Par shart bhi hai, aur woh dhyaan se suno.

121
00:07:24,781 --> 00:07:27,947
Yeh bond lambe samay ke liye hai.

122
00:07:27,947 --> 00:07:32,018
RBI ke through bond jaldi todna, yaani premature redemption,

123
00:07:32,018 --> 00:07:36,089
5 saal poore hone ke baad hi hota hai.

124
00:07:36,089 --> 00:07:40,160
Aur woh bhi sirf byaaj milne wali tareekh par.

125
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:40,974
Iska matlab,

126
00:07:40,974 --> 00:07:45,449
jo paisa aapko agle saal shaadi ya ghar ke liye chahiye,

127
00:07:45,449 --> 00:07:47,891
woh SGB ke liye nahi hai.

128
00:07:47,891 --> 00:07:53,587
Yeh bond un paison ke liye hai jo aap saalon tak bhool sakte ho.

129
00:07:53,587 --> 00:07:56,842
Stock exchange par bechne ka raasta bhi hai,

130
00:07:56,842 --> 00:07:59,690
par wahan sahi khareedar milna zaroori nahi.

131
00:07:59,690 --> 00:08:03,358
Aur tax? Yeh byaaj aapki income mein judta hai,

132
00:08:03,358 --> 00:08:07,841
aur us par aapke slab ke hisaab se tax lagta hai.

133
00:08:07,841 --> 00:08:12,324
Lekin maturity par, yaani bond ki poori avadhi khatam hone par,

134
00:08:12,324 --> 00:08:16,807
original khareedne wale ko capital gains par tax nahi dena padta.

135
00:08:16,807 --> 00:08:19,660
Capital gains yaani bechne par hua munafa.

136
00:08:19,660 --> 00:08:24,148
Bhai bola, toh kal hi le leta hoon. Behen ne roka.

137
00:08:24,148 --> 00:08:27,005
Naye SGB issue har waqt nahi aate,

138
00:08:27,005 --> 00:08:29,861
pehle RBI ki site par check karo.

139
00:08:29,861 --> 00:08:32,309
Aur exchange se purana bond khareeda,

140
00:08:32,309 --> 00:08:35,982
toh tax chhoot ke rules alag ho sakte hain.

141
00:08:35,982 --> 00:08:38,430
Bina samjhe tip par mat kudo.

142
00:08:38,430 --> 00:08:43,086
Doosra roop hai gold ETF. ETF yaani exchange traded fund,

143
00:08:43,086 --> 00:08:48,208
jo stock exchange par share ki tarah khareeda becha jaata hai.

144
00:08:48,208 --> 00:08:52,398
Har unit ke peeche asli sona rakha hota hai.

145
00:08:52,398 --> 00:08:57,520
Iske liye demat account chahiye, yaani shares rakhne ka digital khata.

146
00:08:57,520 --> 00:09:01,451
Gold ETF mein bhi making charge nahi, locker nahi,

147
00:09:01,451 --> 00:09:04,508
purity ki fikar nahi. Aur bechna ho,

148
00:09:04,508 --> 00:09:08,002
toh market khula ho tab bech sakte ho.

149
00:09:08,002 --> 00:09:09,749
Par byaaj nahi milta,

150
00:09:09,749 --> 00:09:13,243
aur fund ka chhota saalana kharcha katta hai.

151
00:09:13,243 --> 00:09:17,610
Isko expense ratio kehte hain, yaani fund chalane ki fees.

152
00:09:17,610 --> 00:09:22,968
Ab sab ko saath rakh kar dekho. Gehna: pehenne ki khushi,

153
00:09:22,968 --> 00:09:26,864
par making charge, GST aur locker ka kharcha.

154
00:09:26,864 --> 00:09:31,248
Gold ETF: aasaan bechna, chhoti fees, koi byaaj nahi.

155
00:09:31,248 --> 00:09:35,145
SGB: byaaj milta hai, maturity par tax chhoot,

156
00:09:35,145 --> 00:09:37,580
par paisa lamba atakta hai.

157
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:41,910
Ab woh galti jo lagbhag har ghar karta hai.

158
00:09:41,910 --> 00:09:45,279
Hum kehte hain, sone ne bahut kamaya,

159
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:50,571
bhaav dekho kahan pahunch gaya. Par hum sirf bhaav ginte hain.

160
00:09:50,571 --> 00:09:52,496
Making charge, GST, locker,

161
00:09:52,496 --> 00:09:57,308
aur bechte waqt ki katauti koi nahi ginta. Aadha hisaab,

162
00:09:57,308 --> 00:09:58,270
poori khushi.

163
00:09:58,270 --> 00:10:01,454
Doosri galti, gehne ko emergency fund samajhna.

164
00:10:01,454 --> 00:10:04,638
Mushkil waqt mein Mummy ka kangan bechna,

165
00:10:04,638 --> 00:10:07,368
mann par bhi bhaari padta hai.

166
00:10:07,368 --> 00:10:11,461
Aur tab jeweller ki shart par bechna padta hai.

167
00:10:11,461 --> 00:10:15,555
Emergency ke liye woh paisa chahiye jo turant mile,

168
00:10:15,555 --> 00:10:16,920
bina nuksaan ke.

169
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:20,656
Toh karein kya? Pehli baat, gehne ko gehna samjho.

170
00:10:20,656 --> 00:10:23,977
Pehenne ke liye lo, khushi ke liye lo.

171
00:10:23,977 --> 00:10:27,713
Hallmark wala gehna lo, aur bill sambhal kar rakho.

172
00:10:27,713 --> 00:10:31,034
Making charge par mol bhaav bhi hota hai.

173
00:10:31,034 --> 00:10:34,770
Bechne se pehle alag alag jewellers se bhaav poochho.

174
00:10:34,770 --> 00:10:37,972
Doosri baat, agar sona bachat ke liye chahiye,

175
00:10:37,972 --> 00:10:40,773
toh paper gold ke baare mein padho.

176
00:10:40,773 --> 00:10:42,774
Lambe samay ke liye SGB,

177
00:10:42,774 --> 00:10:46,376
aur jaldi zaroorat ho sakti hai toh gold ETF.

178
00:10:46,376 --> 00:10:49,578
Dono ke rules, tax aur kharche khud samjho.

179
00:10:49,578 --> 00:10:53,580
Zaroorat ho toh apne CA ya adviser se baat karo.

180
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:57,228
Teesri baat, saari bachat sone mein mat daalo.

181
00:10:57,228 --> 00:10:59,965
Sona mushkil waqt ka saathi hai,

182
00:10:59,965 --> 00:11:02,701
par uska bhaav girta bhi hai,

183
00:11:02,701 --> 00:11:06,805
saalon tak ruka bhi reh sakta hai. Thoda sona,

184
00:11:06,805 --> 00:11:10,910
baaki alag alag jagah. Yeh investment advice nahi hai.

185
00:11:10,910 --> 00:11:13,190
Sirf samajh ki baat hai.

186
00:11:13,190 --> 00:11:18,543
Kahani ke aakhir mein, Mummy ne kangan nahi beche. Unhone kaha,

187
00:11:18,543 --> 00:11:21,949
yeh toh Beti ki shaadi mein jaayenge.

188
00:11:21,949 --> 00:11:26,328
Par agli baar bachat ke liye sona lena hua,

189
00:11:26,328 --> 00:11:30,707
toh Behen ke saath baith kar paper gold samjhengi.

190
00:11:30,707 --> 00:11:34,600
Kangan pyaar ke liye, bond kamaai ke liye.

191
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,918
Ab aapse sawaal.

192
00:11:35,918 --> 00:11:40,310
Aapke ghar mein sona kis roop mein hai: gehna, coin,

193
00:11:40,310 --> 00:11:44,263
ETF ya bond? Comment mein bas woh shabd likho.

194
00:11:44,263 --> 00:11:46,019
Aur yeh bhi batao,

195
00:11:46,019 --> 00:11:51,290
kya kabhi kisi ne aapke ghar mein locker ka kiraya gina hai?

196
00:11:51,290 --> 00:11:55,432
Agle video mein Papa ki FD ki baari hai.

197
00:11:55,432 --> 00:11:57,273
FD safe lagti hai,

198
00:11:57,273 --> 00:12:01,415
par mehngai kaat kar asal mein kitna bachta hai?

199
00:12:01,415 --> 00:12:06,478
Woh kahani bhi isi tarah, ghar ke andar se. Tab tak,

200
00:12:06,478 --> 00:12:10,620
apne gehne ka bill dhoondh kar rakho, kaam aayega.
